/* RULES BEFORE MERGING TABLES */

/* 1. IDENTIFY THE COMMON FIELD */
/* 2. IDENTIFY THE LEFT AND THE RIGHT TABLE */
/* 3. SORT BOTH THE DATASET BY COMMON VARIBLES */

